Apache License 2.0

This project is intended to be licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The sandbox used to build this couldn't reach
apache.org to fetch the exact license text, so before your first
public push, replace this file with the real text from:

https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt

GitHub also does this automatically: when creating the repo (or via
Add file > Create new file > name it LICENSE) GitHub offers a
one-click "Apache License 2.0" template that inserts the correct text
and your name/year automatically.
